    "id":  10871,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "LED Strip 24V RGBIC | COB DIGITAL | 5m | 360LED/m | 9W/M | IP20",
    "reference":  "SP360D-9W-RGB-91864",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003eDiscover our innovative \u003cstrong\u003e9W RGBIC COB LED Strip\u003c/strong\u003e! This new concept offers unprecedented \u003cstrong\u003econtrol\u003c/strong\u003e by allowing you to \u003cstrong\u003eindividually manage each LED in the strip\u003c/strong\u003e. This strip offers you a full spectrum of vibrant colors to unleash your creativity. With \u003cstrong\u003e360 diodes per meter\u003c/strong\u003e and an efficiency of \u003cstrong\u003e140Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e, this strip provides bright and energetic lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIt can be \u003cstrong\u003ecut every 5cm\u003c/strong\u003e. Its IP20 design makes it ideal for indoor applications, where you can enjoy vivid colors and easy installation. It comes with a 3M adhesive strip for easy attachment to any surface.\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLED Strip 24V RGBIC | COB DIGITAL | 5m | 360LED/m | 9W/M | IP20\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDiscover our innovative \u003cstrong\u003e9W DIGITAL RGBIC COB LED Strip!\u003c/strong\u003e This new concept offers unprecedented \u003cstrong\u003econtrol by allowing you to individually manage each LED in the strip\u003c/strong\u003e, giving you endless possibilities to create personalised and vivid environments. With 3W in red, 3W in green and 3W in blue, this strip offers you a full spectrum of vibrant colours to unleash your creativity. With \u003cstrong\u003e360 diodes per metre\u003c/strong\u003e and an efficiency of \u003cstrong\u003e140Lm/W\u003c/strong\u003e, this strip provides bright and energetic lighting. It can be \u003cstrong\u003ecut every 5cm\u003c/strong\u003e. Its IP20 design makes it ideal for indoor applications, where you can enjoy vivid colours and easy installation. It comes with a 3M adhesive strip for easy attachment to any surface.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAn RGBIC strip is a variant of RGBIC LED strip lights. The main difference is that RGBIC strips have the ability to individually control each LED in the strip, which means they can produce more dynamic and complex lighting effects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eterm \"RGBIC\u003c/strong\u003e\" is derived from \"RGBIC with Individual Control\", indicating that\u003cstrong\u003e each LED\u003c/strong\u003e in the strip can be \u003cstrong\u003eindependently controlled\u003c/strong\u003e to display different colours, brightness or effects. This allows for the \u003cstrong\u003ecreation\u003c/strong\u003e of more advanced\u003cstrong\u003e lighting effects\u003c/strong\u003e, such as smooth colour gradients, rainbow effects, dynamic light patterns and synchronisation with music or other stimuli.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cb\u003eOutstanding Benefits of 5M 24V RGBIC COB DIGITAL COB LED Strip 24V RGBIC COB DIGITAL\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUnlimited customisation:\u003c/strong\u003e The RGBIC COB RGBIC LED Strip allows full customisation thanks to its ability to be cut every 5cm. Adapt it to the exact length you need for your lighting projects, from decorative details to more extensive applications.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePowerful brightness and energy efficiency:\u003c/strong\u003e With a total power of 9W and 24V power supply, this strip offers a powerful and crisp brightness, ensuring intense illumination wherever you need it. Plus, its energy efficiency allows you to enjoy spectacular lighting without worrying about excessive power consumption.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTough, durable design:\u003c/strong\u003e The IP20 rating of the strip ensures its suitability for indoor use, protecting the LEDs and ensuring long-lasting performance. Its rugged design gives you the confidence of a reliable and long-lasting lighting solution.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Thanks to its practical design, the RGBIC COB LED Strip is easily installed on any flat surface. Whether it\u0027s to highlight specific areas in your home, create a festive atmosphere or enhance the lighting in your workspace, installation will be quick and hassle-free.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile uses:\u003c/strong\u003e From enhancing the décor at special events to creatively illuminating your living room, this LED strip adapts to a variety of uses. Its versatility gives you the freedom to explore and experiment with lighting in different contexts.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003e\u003cb\u003eFeatured Uses and Applications of 24V RGBIC COB DIGITAL 5M RGBIC LED Strip\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAmbient Lighting:\u003c/strong\u003e Create a welcoming and personalised ambience in your home, highlighting specific areas with the perfect blend of colours.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eParties and Events:\u003c/strong\u003e Add a festive touch to your celebrations with dynamic, eye-catching lighting effects that are sure to leave a lasting impression.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInterior Design:\u003c/strong\u003e Bring your interior design projects to life by highlighting architectural features or accentuating decorative elements with light.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSignage and Display:\u003c/strong\u003e Use the strip to create illuminated signs, eye-catching displays or to highlight products in shop windows.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLight Art Creation:\u003c/strong\u003e Express your creativity by using the strip to create light art, visual installations or custom decorative effects.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eMake every corner a scene of unforgettable colours and experiences with our 9W RGBIC COB LED Strip! Transform your space and add a modern and vibrant touch - don\u0027t wait any longer to light up your life in style!\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e* Power Supply NOT included\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAt FactorLED we ensure that our products have a QUALITY guarantee and offer all the necessary elements for DISTRIBUTION, IMPORT or WHOLESALE, including the technical data sheet of each LED product.\u003c/p\u003e",
